course_info.trial_description:
"Practical English for beginners". At the end of the leson students will learn to:
- meet and greet people at different times of the day;
- understand a conversation about meeting new people at work;
- use appropriate phrases and tone when meeting new people;
- read and understand a personal profile;
- use capital letters and full stops correctly;
- write their own personal profile.
The lesson is based on the textbook "Empower Starter" (Cambridge University Press, 2016). The main focus of the leson - to learn how to meet and greet people properly.
Methods: watching videos about someone meeting new people at work, working with tone and pronunciation, speaking and writing practice. Materials: Textbook "Empower starter",2016, Workbook, photocopiable activities.
